# View Assist: Vacuum view (panel = the map card fills the entire screen)
#
# Installation: Open the View Assist dashboard > Edit > Three-dot menu > Raw configuration editor
# and insert this block under "views:" (using the same indentation as the other views).
# Resulting path: /view-assist/vacuum (= default value in the blueprint).
#
# The card configuration is identical to your existing Xiaomi Vacuum Map Card setup.
#
# View Assist: Vacuum view (panel = the map card fills the whole screen)
#
# Einbau: View-Assist-Dashboard oeffnen > Stift > drei Punkte > Raw-Konfigurationseditor
# und diesen Block unter "views:" einfuegen (gleiche Einrueckung wie die anderen Views).
# Pfad danach: /view-assist/vacuum  (= Standardwert im Blueprint)
#
# Die Karte ist 1:1 deine eigene Xiaomi-Vacuum-Map-Card-Konfiguration.

  - title: Vacuum
    path: vacuum
    type: panel
    cards:
    - type: custom:xiaomi-vacuum-map-card
      entity: vacuum.valetudo_shockingmustyreindeer
      map_source:
        camera: camera.valetudo_d9_shockingmustyreindeer_camera
      calibration_source:
        camera: true
      vacuum_platform: Hypfer/Valetudo
      internal_variables:
        topic: valetudo/ShockingMustyReindeer
